ts) in our Pistol Clinics.<br \/>\n-  Parents of youth attending, please read our Message to Parents.<br \/>\nSubject to state and local laws, Instructors at your event may have discounted .22 ammo available. Reach out to the contact at the bottom of this page for availability.<br \/>\nRange Fee:  $10\/day<br \/>\nCamping Available:  Fall Creek Falls State Park is about a 30 minute drive from the range.<br \/>\nHotels: Hotels available in McMinnville, TN and in Dunlap, TN. Each about 20-30 minutes from the range. Also several AirBnB's are available.<br \/>\nDirections:<br \/>\nFrom Nashville take I-24 East 64 miles to\u00a0 Manchester, take Exit 111B TN 55 E to TN 8 S\/Harrison Ferry Road 35.1 miles Range will be on the right<br \/>\nFrom Chattanooga take US 27 N 22.1 Miles to TN 111 N follow for 31.4 miles to TN 8 N for 8.1 miles. Range will be on the left.<br \/>\nGPS: 35.589309,-85.588203<br \/>\nState Laws to be aware of:<br \/>\nIt is the responsibility of attendees to know and comply with all State and Federal Firearms Laws.<br \/>\nTennessee State Firearms Laws<br \/>\nMisc:<br \/>\nFor more information contact:<br \/>\nName: TN State Coordinator Email Address: TN@appleseedinfo.org<br \/>\nName: Rick Martin Phone: 207-351-5680<\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"pistol-clinic-10","image":false,"all_day":false,"start_date":"2026-10-17 09:00:00","start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"17","hour":"09","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"end_date":"2026-10-17 09:00:00","end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"17","hour":"09","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"utc_start_date":"2026-10-17 09:00:00","utc_start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"17","hour":"09","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"utc_end_date":"2026-10-17 09:00:00","utc_end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"17","hour":"09","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"timezone":"UTC","timezone_abbr":"UTC","cost":"","cost_details":{"currency_symbol":"","currency_code":"","curre