ed will be donated.<br \/>\nIMPORTANT Change: Match fee payment for member and non-members will take place at the Club House and will begin from 7:15 am to 8:15 am on match day. Please provide receipt to the Match Director at the Action Bays before match begins.<br \/>\nCheck in no later than 8:30 a.m. at the Action Bay number two. Match will begin after our mandatory safety briefing.<br \/>\nRegistration on Practiscore mandatory, NO WALK-ON'S.<br \/>\nJim Matrangos 912-996-3620<\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"[long]","image":false,"all_day":false,"start_date":"2026-10-17 12:30:00","start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"17","hour":"12","minutes":"30","seconds":"00"},"end_date":"2026-10-17 17:00:00","end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"17","hour":"17","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"utc_start_date":"2026-10-17 12:30:00","utc_start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"17","hour":"12","minutes":"30","seconds":"00"},"utc_end_date":"2026-10-17 17:00:00","utc_end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"17","hour":"17","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"timezone":"UTC","timezone_abbr":"UTC","cost":"","cost_details":{"currency_symbol":"","currency_code":"","currency_position":"","values":[]},"website":"","show_map":false,"show_map_link":false,"hide_from_listings":false,"sticky":false,"featured":false,"categories":[],"tags":[],"venue":{"id":365227,"status":"publish","date":"2026-04-28 13:03:56","date_utc":"2026-04-28 20:03:56","modified":"2026-09-30 03:33:11","modified_utc":"2026-09-30 10:33:11","url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/venue\[long]\/","venue":"1290 County Road 90E, Bunnell FL, United States","slug":"[long]","show_map":true,"show_map_link":true,"global_id":"gunstuff.tv?id=365227","global_id_lineage":["gunstuff.tv?id=365227"]},"organizer":[],"custom_fields":[],"is_virtual":false,"virtual_url":null,"virtual_video_source":""},{"id":427794,"global_id":"gunstuff.tv?id=427794","global_id_lineage":["gunstuff.tv?id=427794"],"author":"1","status":"publish","date":"2026-07-22 00:10:02","date_utc":"2026-07-22 07:10:02","modified":"2026-09-30 03:30:05","modified_utc":"2026-09-30 10:30:05","url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/event\/shoot-sig-flagler-gun-archery-club\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/427794","title":"SHOOT SIG - Flagler Gun &amp; Archery Club","description":"<p>Whether you\u2019re new to shooting competitions or an experienced competitor, you\u2019ll enjoy 3 approachable stages that can be completed with less than 100 rounds and in under an hour. Compete again in the same or another division for a discounted match fee. Bring any pistol or PCC or try out a new SIG pistol or PCC for an additional fee. You must be a SHOOT SIG member and shoot a SIG firearm to be eligible for prizes.<br \/>\n*NOTE: If you want to shoot in more than one Division or multiple entries in a single Division, you must first complete your initial registration and pay the initial $45 match fee. Then, you must register for each additional entry and select \"Additional Division\" under Extras in the payment information section to receive the discounted match fee of $25. Each additional entry in this manner will allow you to pick a respective Division and Squad; this will result in multiple registrations for the same match being displayed under your PractiScore dashboard profile.<br \/>\n**NOTE: As a reminder, we operate using a \"cold range\" principle which means all firearms are to remain unloaded and in your gun bag\/box or holster until you are under the direct supervision of a SHOOT SIG Range Officer and have been instructed to \"load and make ready\" on a prescribed course of fire. If you are planning to shoot the match with your carry gun and you arrive to the range with a loaded (hot) firearm, we will have designated safe areas clearly marked where you can safely unload your firearm prior to checking in. Please plan to arrive 15-20 minutes ahead of your scheduled start ti