hin 20mins drive:<br \/>\nBudget Motel (386)437-0555<br \/>\nHilton Garden Inn (386)586-2463<br \/>\nHampton Inn (386)439-8999<br \/>\nHoliday Inn Express (386)439-3939<br \/>\nDirections:<br \/>\nThe range is located at 1290 County Road 90E, west of Bunnell, Florida. Bunnell is located at the intersections of SR 100 and US 1. It can be reached by either of the following: Exit Interstate 95 at exit # 284 (SR 100) and following SR100 west to Bunnell or following U.S. 1 south from St. Augustine or north from Daytona \u00a0or Ormond Beach.<br \/>\nOnce you are in Bunnell, follow State Road 100 west towards Palatka. Turn left onto County Road 302, which is approximately 3 miles from US1. Follow CR302 to the flashing light at CR305. Turn left onto CR305. Follow CR305 to the first left, CR90E (Tangerine Ave.). Turn left onto CR90E and go approximately 1 1\/2 miles and you will see the club on the right.<br \/>\nYou can also follow SR100 to CR305 and follow CR305 to CR90E. We recommend you avoid CR75 unless you like bumpy dirt roads.<br \/>\nGPS: 29.438328,-81.350586<br \/>\nState Laws to be aware of:<br \/>\nIt is the responsibility of attendees to know and comply with all State and Federal Firearms Laws.<br \/>\nFlorida State Firearms Laws<br \/>\nMisc:<br \/>\nPre-register for this event and be sure of your spot on the line!<br \/>\nThis facility offers range to 100 yards. \u00a0Bring both .22LR and center fire rifles!<br \/>\nFor more information contact:<br \/>\nName: FL State Coordinator Email Address: FL@appleseedinfo.org<br \/>\nName: Glenn Padgett Phone: 386-679-3862<\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"rimfire-known-distance-5","image":false,"all_day":false,"start_date":"2026-10-24 09:00:00","start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"24","hour":"09","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"end_date":"2026-10-24 09:00:00","end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"24","hour":"09","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"utc_start_date":"2026-10-24 09:00:00","utc_start