_lineage":["gunstuff.tv?id=458980"],"author":"1","status":"publish","date":"2026-09-30 03:34:11","date_utc":"2026-09-30 10:34:11","modified":"2026-09-30 03:34:11","modified_utc":"2026-09-30 10:34:11","url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/event\/october-steel-challange-at-manatee\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/458980","title":"October Steel Challange at Manatee","description":"<p>Update: If you would like to remain with the shooters you squadded with, be sure to reach out to me. \ud83d\ude42 For this match im going to try to balance the squads the night before in an attempt to keep everything flowing smoothly.<br \/>\nWelcome to Manatee Gun and Archery Club's ongoing Steel Challenge Competition!!!<br \/>\nRRO and RRI WELCOME!!<br \/>\nSchedule:<br \/>\nGate opens at 0800<br \/>\nCheck in \/ Registration closes at 0845<br \/>\nSaftey Brief at 0850<br \/>\nHammer down at 0900<br \/>\nThis is an 8 stage match, 6 stages on the 3 action bays and the final two on the Area 51 bay. Please feel free to drive to area 51 as it is about 400 yards from stage stage 6 (accelerator).<br \/>\nAll targets are GT targets!!<br \/>\nAll shooters who haven't been to manatee in over 12 months will need to fill out liability waivers on the main office's iPads. Once they have the waiver on file (good for a full 12 months) they will issue you a wrist band. Once you have your band, come see me on the middle bay so I can check you in.<br \/>\nFirst gun is 26 dollars, second gun is 16! (be sure to use the $-11 option for the second gun.)<br \/>\nPrepayment is required, so if you need to withdraw please do so as soon as possible so we can issue refunds. No refunds once the registration closes. (Registration closes 6:00pm the night before the match.)<br \/>\nPS - I do not receive emails sent to practiscore, so please feel free to email me at nelson390@hotmail.com<\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"october-steel-challange-at-manatee","image":false,"all_day":false,"start_d